export anchor AmbientHazeStyle:
    number: 331
    screen: MusicPlayer
    name: Ambient haze
    idea: A quiet room of soft blurred colour fog behind a single centred column, with light thin type, hairline progress and almost invisible controls, so the song and its words float and nothing asks for attention.
    base: dark
    palette:
        nightAir: #0d0e13, the page, the room and the style sheet
        fogViolet: #4b3a6b, a blurred fog bank at the top left, decorative
        fogTeal: #24505a, a blurred fog bank at the right, decorative
        fogRose: #5a3346, a blurred fog bank at the bottom, decorative
        veil: #171820, frosted panels at about 72 percent over the fog
        mistLine: #3a3b48, hairlines, the progress track and field rules
        moon: #eeedf4, the title, the current lyric and primary text
        dusk: #b6b4c6, artists, times, labels and the waiting lyric
        glow: #c9b8ff, the progress dot, the liked heart, the play ring and focus
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        mostly at weight 300. Base 16px at 1.6. The title is clamp 40 to
        60px at 200 with 0.01em tracking, the current lyric clamp 20 to
        28px at 300, the waiting lyric up to 20px, and lowercase labels
        13px at 400 with 0.08em tracking.
    layout:
        One centred column in a dark room. Three very large blurred colour
        fogs drift slowly behind everything, violet top left, teal right
        and rose low in the middle, clipped by the room. A faint top line
        reads brightwork sound and now playing in lowercase. After about
        90px of space comes from Low Tide, then Harbour Lights in thin
        large type and the artist. A 1px progress hairline runs between the
        elapsed and total time with a small glowing dot at just under half.
        The controls sit in one quiet row, line icons over small words,
        shuffle off, previous, a 64px thin glow ring with pause, next,
        repeat off and a filled heart over liked. A volume hairline with
        70% follows. Further down a lowercase words label sits over the
        current line in moon behind a small glow dot and the next line
        smaller in dusk. Two frosted panels with 24px corners close the
        page, after this with the five queued songs on hairline rows, and
        your library with the playlists and counts and underlined links
        for Albums, Artists and Podcasts. Below 820px the panels stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit used wide. About 90px above the title, 48 to 72px between groups and 28 to 32px panel padding.
    density: Very low. One column and five quiet rows, nothing competing.
    corners: 24px panels, a round play ring and pill buttons.
    borders: 1px mist line hairlines at most, often none.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from the fog and the frosted panels with a 20px backdrop blur.
    icons:
        Thin line icons at low emphasis with lowercase words beneath.
        Shuffle and repeat say off in words. Liked is a filled glow heart
        over the word liked. The current lyric has a small dot.
    focus: A 2px glow outline offset 4px with a soft 12px glow halo.
    tone: Soft lowercase labels, such as now playing, words, after this and your library.
